[01:12.88] I walked (I walked and walked)
[01:15.85] Like a zombie in the night
[01:18.82] You came (you came, you came)
[01:21.83] And you brought me back to life
[01:24.98] I tried so hard (I tried, I tried)
[01:27.59] To become the one you need
[01:30.60] But now you think that you're not enough for me
[01:38.15] 
